      "fact_text": {
        "text": "A for loop in Java consists of three parts: an initialization of a counter variable, a boolean condition that determines how many times the loop executes, and an increment operation.",
        "refs": ["Q0000", "Q0001"]
      },
      "fact_type": null
    },
    {
      "fact_text": {
        "text": "The loop executes its body while the condition is true; after each iteration the counter is incremented, and when the condition becomes false the loop terminates.",
        "refs": ["Q0002", "Q0003", "Q0004"]
      },
      "fact_type": null
    }
  ],
  "formulas": [],
  "procedures": [
    {
      "procedure_name": {
        "text": "Print \"Hello World\" five times using a for loop",
        "refs": ["Q0000", "Q0001", "Q0002", "Q0003", "Q0004", "Q0005"]
      },
      "prerequisites": null,
      "steps": [
        {
          "text": "Start with the for keyword and an opening parenthesis.",
          "refs": ["Q0000"]
        },
        {
          "text": "Initialize a counter variable, e.g., int i = 0.",
          "refs": ["Q0000"]
        },
        {
          "text": "Add a semicolon to terminate the initialization statement.",
          "refs": ["Q0001"]
        },
        {
          "text": "Write a boolean condition, e.g., i < 5, that determines how many times the loop runs.",
          "refs": ["Q0001"]
        },
        {
          "text": "Add a semicolon to terminate the condition.",
          "refs": ["Q0001"]
        },
        {
          "text": "Write the increment expression, e.g., i++.",
          "refs": ["Q0001"]
        },
        {
          "text": "Close the parentheses and add the loop body; for a single statement no braces are needed.",
          "refs": ["Q0002"]
        },
        {
          "text": "Place the statement to be repeated, e.g., System.out.println(\"Hello World\");",
          "refs": ["Q0002", "Q0005"]
        },
        {
          "text": "Optionally, add a space and concatenate the counter variable to the output if desired.",
          "refs": ["Q0004"]
        },
        {
          "text": "Close the loop with a closing brace if a block was opened.",
          "refs": ["Q0002"]
        }
      ],
      "outcomes": null,
      "content": {
        "text": "The loop prints \"Hello World\" five times on the terminal.",
        "refs": ["Q0005"]
      }
    }
  ],
